    "title": "Hide From Daddy: Little Escape",
    "description": "Hide From Daddy: Little Escape is a simple fun game, In this baby escape game you will enjoy the fun of a little \"Funny\" baby.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf7c HOW TO PLAY \ud83c\udf7c\r\n- Move the baby with the joystick and avoid the parents to avoid being caught\r\n- Feed the Baby if necessary to get boosters\r\n- Hide behind the tables to get to the objective.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf7c GAME FEATURE \ud83c\udf7c\r\n- Never get bored with endless level\r\n- Explore multiple playrooms in the house\r\n- Unlock various characters and trail effects\r\n- Animation graphics with cool colors\r\n\r\nFIND FUN TIME with our <b> Hide From Daddy: Little Escape </b>!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hide From Daddy: Little Escape is a simple fun game, In this baby escape game you will enjoy the fun of a little &quot;Funny&quot; baby.<br><br>\ud83c\udf7c HOW TO PLAY \ud83c\udf7c<br>- Move the baby with the joystick and avoid the parents to avoid being caught<br>- Feed the Baby if necessary to get boosters<br>- Hide behind the tables to get to the objective.<br><br>\ud83c\udf7c GAME FEATURE \ud83c\udf7c<br>- Never get bored with endless level<br>- Explore multiple playrooms in the house<br>- Unlock various characters and trail effects<br>- Animation graphics with cool colors<br><br>FIND FUN TIME with our <b> Hide From Daddy: Little Escape </b>!!",
